        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Workspace Bridge Apertures\n\nKeep authored edges local to portals. When a portal target is spatially present, a compatible bridge permits Twilite to render that same semantic endpoint through a workspace aperture using its live representation. Connection, disconnection, and foldout change representation without retargeting the edge."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "ownsContent": true,
          "surfaceDelegation": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "workspace-bridge-apertures-declaration"
        },
        "markdown": "# Workspace Bridge Apertures\n\nKeep authored edges local to portals. When a portal target is spatially present, a compatible bridge permits Twilite to render that same semantic endpoint through a workspace aperture using its live representation. Connection, disconnection, and foldout change representation without retargeting the edge."
      }
    },
